<title>PHILIPPINES: Solidbank Q1 net at 163.68 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Solidbank Q1 net at 163.68 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solidbank Corp posted a 163.68 million peso net profit in the first quarter of the year, documents submitted to the Philippine Stock Exchange on Friday showed.</p>
<p>Total operating income reached 1.21 billion pesos, while operating expenses amounted to 1.01 billion pesos.</p>
<p>The bank also incurred an extraordinary income of 7.05 million pesos and paid out 43.16 million pesos in tax.</p>
<p>No comparatives for the year earlier were available.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
